For json 
--------

where column_name::text ILIKE '%pan%'



| Requirement             | Query                                   |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Search anywhere in JSON | details::text ILIKE '%pan%'           |
| Search top-level key    | details->>'key' = 'value'             |
| Search nested key       | details->'parent'->>'child' = 'value' |
| Fast JSONB search       | details @> '{"key":"value"}'          |




